tor><category>学山禅师</category><category>释学山</category><category>禅宗</category><category>佛</category><category>禅宗</category><category>佛</category></item><item><title>万法归心录</title><link>https://siteofen.github.io/zh/%E4%BD%9B/%E7%A6%85%E5%AE%97/%E4%B8%87%E6%B3%95%E5%BD%92%E5%BF%83%E5%BD%95/</link><pubDate>Sun, 10 Apr 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Sun, 10 Apr 2022 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://siteofen.github.io/zh/%E4%BD%9B/%E7%A6%85%E5%AE%97/%E4%B8%87%E6%B3%95%E5%BD%92%E5%BF%83%E5%BD%95/</guid><description>续藏经 万法归心录 清 超溟着 清祖源超溟撰，明贯编。全书三卷。清康熙十六年（1677）序刊。本书旨在阐明“三教为殊途同归之法”，因“万法归于一心”</description><dc:creator>祖源禅师</dc:creator><category>禅宗</category><category>佛</category><category>禅宗</category></item></channel></rss>